_title:`What does System Reset do?`,set_wipe_info_1:`Creates an automatic, timestamped SQLite backup in server/data/backups/ before any data is deleted.`,set_wipe_info_2:`Completely clears all inventory medicines, batch records, stock-in/dispensing transactions, purchase orders, alert acknowledgments, evaluations, and audit logs.`,set_wipe_info_3:`Resets table ID autoincrement sequences back to 1.`,set_wipe_info_4:`Retains your administrator user account credentials and default clinic configuration settings.`,set_wipe_info_5:`Sets the auto-seed prevention flag so rebooting the workstation will not repopulate mock data.`,set_initiate_wipe_btn:`Initiate Factory System Reset & Wipe`,set_confirm_wipe_title:`Confirm Factory System Reset`,set_confirm_wipe_warning:`Irreversible Production Data Wipe`,set_confirm_wipe_desc:`You are about to permanently erase all medicines, batches, purchase orders, dispensing logs, and audit records from this workstation.`,set_confirm_wipe_safety:`Safety Note: A full database snapshot will be automatically saved to data/backups/ before wiping. Admin credentials and system settings will be preserved.`,set_confirm_wipe_prompt:`To confirm, type RESET in capital letters below:`,set_cancel_wipe_btn:`Cancel`,set_execute_wipe_btn:`Permanently Wipe & Reset Database`,set_executing_wipe_btn:`Executing System Reset...`,cal_day_sun:`Sun`,cal_day_mon:`Mon`,cal_day_tue:`Tue`,cal_day_wed:`Wed`,cal_day_thu:`Thu`,cal_day_fri:`Fri`,cal_day_sat:`Sat`,cal_prev_month:`Previous month`,cal_next_month:`Next month`,dosage_form_tablet:`Tablet`,dosage_form_capsule:`Capsule`,dosage_form_syrup:`Syrup`,dosage_form_suspension:`Suspension`,dosage_form_drops:`Drops`,dosage_form_ointment_cream:`Ointment / Cream`,dosage_form_vial_ampoule:`Vial / Ampoule`,pkg_unit_bottle:`Bottle`,pkg_unit_piece:`Piece`,pkg_unit_blister:`Blister Pack`,pkg_unit_box:`Box`,pkg_unit_tube:`Tube`,cat_vitamins:`Vitamins & Supplements`,cat_antihistamine:`Antihistamine`,cat_respiratory:`Respiratory`,cat